---
import A from "../components/A.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import { SCHOLAR } from "../data/links";
import { UI, type Lang } from "../i18n";

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const b = "font-semibold text-gray-900";
---

<Section id="about" title={UI[lang].titles.about}>
  {
    lang === "zh" ? (
      <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600">
        <p class="t-lead">
          我现任上海奇绩智峰智能科技有限公司（<strong class={b}>北坡</strong>）<strong class={b}>计算机使用智能体（CUA）负责人</strong>，从 0 到 1 主导
          <A href="#northcua">NorthCUA</A>，构建覆盖统一 Harness、经验数据、模型训练与持续学习的 CUA 闭环；推出 Nano、Mini、Pro
          三档开源模型，在 GUI 定位、桌面执行与 Web 交互三个方向达到开源模型 SOTA（按技术报告的评测设置）。同时负责
          <A href="https://nex-agi.com">Nex-N2.5</A> 的 CUA 与 Web Agent 能力。
        </p>
        <p>
          此前任微软（Microsoft AI / 微软亚洲研究院）<strong class={b}>首席研究员（Principal Researcher）</strong>，是业界首个开源 Windows GUI
          Agent / CUA 框架 <A href="https://github.com/microsoft/UFO/">UFO</A> 的主要开发者与算法研究者，推动其从 UFO 演进到 UFO² 与 UFO³，成为跨平台、跨设备的
          Desktop AgentOS，项目累计 <strong class={b}>10K+ GitHub Stars</strong>。我也长期从事 AIOps 研究：云服务时序异常检测、故障诊断与根因分析。我维护着一份公开的
          LLM 驱动 GUI 智能体<A href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.18279">综述</A>（<A href="https://vyokky.github.io/LLM-Brained-GUI-Agents-Survey/">网站</A>），并出版了市面上首本系统介绍
          GUI 智能体的著作；<A href={SCHOLAR}>Google Scholar</A> 引用量已超过 <strong class={b}>8,100</strong> 次。
        </p>
        <p>
          更早之前，我在腾讯光子工作室群担任算法研究员，为《英雄联盟手游》研发匹配系统。我在爱丁堡大学信息学院获得博士学位，导师为
          <A href="https://homepages.inf.ed.ac.uk/ppatras/">Paul Patras</A> 与 <A href="https://homepages.inf.ed.ac.uk/rsarkar/">Rik Sarkar</A>；同校获得人工智能硕士学位；本科毕业于华中科技大学通信工程专业。
        </p>
        <p>如有任何问题，欢迎通过 <strong class={b}>vyokky at 163 dot com</strong> 联系我。</p>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600">
        <p class="t-lead">
          I am the <strong class={b}>Head of Computer-Using Agents (CUA)</strong> at <strong class={b}>Beipo (北坡)</strong>, where I lead{" "}
          <A href="#northcua">NorthCUA</A> from zero to one: an experience-driven loop that connects a unified agent harness, experience data,
          model training and continual learning for agents that operate real desktop software and the web. Its open Nano, Mini and Pro models are
          state-of-the-art among open-source models (under the reported settings) in GUI grounding, desktop execution and web interaction. I am
          also responsible for the CUA and Web Agent capabilities of <A href="https://nex-agi.com">Nex-N2.5</A>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before that, I was a <strong class={b}>Principal Researcher</strong> in the Data, Knowledge and Intelligence <strong class={b}>(DKI)</strong>{" "}
          group at <strong class={b}>Microsoft</strong>, where I was the lead developer and algorithm researcher of{" "}
          <A href="https://github.com/microsoft/UFO/">UFO</A>, the first open-source Windows GUI agent / CUA framework, and drove its evolution
          through UFO² and UFO³ into a cross-platform, cross-device Desktop AgentOS with <strong class={b}>10K+ GitHub stars</strong>. I also
          worked on AIOps: anomaly detection, failure diagnosis and root cause analysis for cloud services. I maintain a public{" "}
          <A href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.18279">survey</A> on LLM-brained GUI agents (
          <A href="https://vyokky.github.io/LLM-Brained-GUI-Agents-Survey/">Website</A>) and wrote the first book that systematically introduces
          GUI agents. My work has been cited over <strong class={b}>8,100</strong> times on <A href={SCHOLAR}>Google Scholar</A>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Earlier, I was a research scientist at Lightspeed and Quantum Studio <strong class={b}>(光子工作室)</strong>, Tencent, where I developed
          matchmaking systems for the game <i>League of Legends: Wild Rift</i>. I hold a PhD from the School of Informatics at the University of
          Edinburgh, supervised by <A href="https://homepages.inf.ed.ac.uk/ppatras/">Prof. Paul Patras</A> and{" "}
          <A href="https://homepages.inf.ed.ac.uk/rsarkar/">Rik Sarkar</A>, an MSc in Artificial Intelligence from the same institution, and a
          BEng in Telecommunication Engineering from Huazhong University of Science and Technology.
        </p>
        <p>
          For any inquiries, please feel free to reach me at <strong class={b}>vyokky at 163 dot com</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    )
  }
</Section>
